{
  "id": "thermocouples",
  "title": "Thermocouples",
  "description": "Calculator for thermocouple temperature conversions and analysis. Convert between Celsius, Fahrenheit, Kelvin, and Rankine scales.",
  "type": "calculator",
  "components": [
    {
      "type": "markdown",
      "content": "## Thermocouple Temperature Conversion\n\nThis tool converts between different temperature scales commonly used in thermocouple applications.\n\n### Temperature Conversion Formulas:\n- **Fahrenheit to Celsius**: oC = (oF - 32) × 0.555\n- **Celsius to Fahrenheit**: oF = (1.8 × oC) + 32\n- **Celsius to Kelvin**: Kelvin = oC + 273.2\n- **Fahrenheit to Rankine**: oRankin = oF + 459.67\n\n### Common Thermocouple Types:\n| Type | Metals | Max Temp (°C) | Sensitivity (mV/°C) |\n|------|--------|--------------|---------------------|\n| T | Copper-Constantan | 400 | 0.045 |\n| J | Iron-Constantan | 850 | 0.068 |\n| E | Chromel-Constantan | 700 | 0.050 |\n| K | Chromel-Alumel | 1100 | 0.041 |\n| N | Nicrosil-Nisil | 1250 | 0.039 |"
    },
    {
      "type": "calculator",
      "inputs": [
        {
          "id": "celsius",
          "label": "Temperature (Celsius)",
          "type": "number",
          "unit": "°C",
          "defaultValue": 0
        }
      ],
      "outputs": [
        {
          "id": "fahrenheit",
          "label": "Temperature (Fahrenheit)",
          "unit": "°F",
          "formula": "(inputs.celsius * 1.8) + 32",
          "format": "decimal"
        },
        {
          "id": "kelvin",
          "label": "Temperature (Kelvin)",
          "unit": "K",
          "formula": "inputs.celsius + 273.2",
          "format": "decimal"
        },
        {
          "id": "rankine",
          "label": "Temperature (Rankine)",
          "unit": "°R",
          "formula": "((inputs.celsius * 1.8) + 32) + 459.67",
          "format": "decimal"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "calculator",
      "inputs": [
        {
          "id": "fahrenheit_input",
          "label": "Temperature (Fahrenheit)",
          "type": "number",
          "unit": "°F",
          "defaultValue": 32
        }
      ],
      "outputs": [
        {
          "id": "celsius_from_f",
          "label": "Temperature (Celsius)",
          "unit": "°C",
          "formula": "(inputs.fahrenheit_input - 32) * 0.555",
          "format": "decimal"
        },
        {
          "id": "kelvin_from_f",
          "label": "Temperature (Kelvin)",
          "unit": "K",
          "formula": "((inputs.fahrenheit_input - 32) * 0.555) + 273.2",
          "format": "decimal"
        },
        {
          "id": "rankine_from_f",
          "label": "Temperature (Rankine)",
          "unit": "°R",
          "formula": "inputs.fahrenheit_input + 459.67",
          "format": "decimal"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "datatable",
      "headers": [
        "Thermocouple Type",
        "Metal Combination",
        "Max Continuous (°C)",
        "Max Spot (°C)",
        "Sensitivity (mV/°C)"
      ],
      "rows": [
        [
          "T",
          "Copper-Constantan",
          "400",
          "500",
          "0.045"
        ],
        [
